{"id":"n32534-1-12","stage":3,"title":"기획 · 规划","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32534-1-12-1","ko":"요즘에 왜 그렇게 바빠?","zh":"最近怎么这么忙啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘에","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘에","audio":"/audio/ae9d7ba24f3a13d06bd3.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"바빠?","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바빠","audio":"/audio/173282bc50b8eef3452e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2a07fee40fc4c849af3c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32534-1-12-2","ko":"이번에 새로 출간할 책의 기획을 맡았거든.","zh":"因为我负责这次要新出版的书的策划工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"출간할","meaning":"出刊，出版","explanation":"출간하다：出刊，出版；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"출간하다","audio":"/audio/1c5c9859ee22fcf2935c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78970","senseId":"1","lemma":"출간하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"출간할","audio":"/audio/4cefe5698fcb684f4324.mp3"}},{"text":"책의","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책의","audio":"/audio/bfb9d681565575d81184.mp3"}},{"text":"기획을","meaning":"规划，企划，筹划","explanation":"기획：规划，企划，筹划；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기획","audio":"/audio/ee6be510a288bb24a3ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32534","senseId":"1","lemma":"기획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기획을","audio":"/audio/c702cc272b26f17ca520.mp3"}},{"text":"맡았거든.","meaning":"负责","explanation":"맡다：负责；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"맡다","audio":"/audio/0ce6c4ebbc3bfd2367dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62827","senseId":"1","lemma":"맡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맡았거든","audio":"/audio/3440bfa16b8641eddf89.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"1c5c9859ee22fcf2","term":"출간하다","zh":"出刊，出版","audio":"/audio/1c5c9859ee22fcf2935c.mp3","entryId":"78970","definition":"将文字、画作或乐谱等印刷成册，使其问世。","pronunciation":["출간하다"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"ee6be510a288bb24","term":"기획","zh":"规划，企划，筹划","audio":"/audio/ee6be510a288bb24a3ba.mp3","entryId":"32534","definition":"事先详细地计划活动或事情等的程序及内容。","pronunciation":["기획","기훽"]},{"id":"0ce6c4ebbc3bfd23","term":"맡다","zh":"负责","audio":"/audio/0ce6c4ebbc3bfd2367dc.mp3","entryId":"62827","definition":"承担责任做某件事。","pronunciation":["맏따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5c23a5bce1ce13c4af58.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=32534","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":104,"sequenceScore":2.7353,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为我负责这次要新出版的书的策划工作。","最近您还是非常忙吗？","最近怎么这么忙啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为我负责这次要新出版的书的策划工作。","最近怎么这么忙啊？","最近您还是非常忙吗？"],"answer":0}]}
